## Transparent FSM example with a tuple payload.

fsm Cure.Turnstile state Tuple(Int, Int) initial :locked events Atom transition
  pickup
    `and`(state == :locked, event == :coin) -> %[:next_state, :unlocked, %[data.1 + 1, data.2]]
    `and`(state == :unlocked, event == :push) -> %[:next_state, :locked, %[data.1, data.2 + 1]]
    `and`(state == :unlocked, event == :coin) -> %[:next_state, :unlocked, %[data.1 + 1, data.2]]
    else -> %[:next_state, state, data]
